> >  include/asm-ia64/delay.h      |   53 -------------
> >  include/asm-ia64/privop.h     |  160=20
> > ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
> >  include/asm-ia64/processor.h  |   56 --------------
> >  include/asm-ia64/system.h     |   12 +--
> >  15 files changed, 217 insertions(+), 140 deletions(-)
> >=20
> > > -----Original Message-----
